": "toolu_01M3DYW8hs5HZ5E5QWBTyowM", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57158, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01M3DYW8hs5HZ5E5QWBTyowM", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57158, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01M3DYW8hs5HZ5E5QWBTyowM", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 62475, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "The incident was created despite the timeout (INC-0001), so no retry was needed.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Rollback completed** \u2014 checkout-api is now on **v2.3.0** in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), healthy, with error rate down from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**What happened:**\n1. Confirmed v2.3.1 was unhealthy across all regions. Release history identified **v2.3.0** as the most recent release that was healthy in production (v2.2.9 was older; v2.3.1-rc was staging-only and unhealthy, so not a candidate).\n2. First rollback attempt **partially failed** \u2014 an orchestrator error halted it after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, the other two still on v2.3.1).\n3. Retried the rollback, which completed successfully in all three regions. Verified health afterward.\n4. Opened **SEV2 incident INC-0001** for checkout-api with the full details above. The `create_incident` call timed out, but I verified via `list_incidents` that it had been created, so I did not retry (avoiding a duplicate page to on-call).\n\n**Suggested follow-ups** (noted in the incident): root-cause v2.3.1 before any redeploy, and investigate the orchestrator error that interrupted the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": nu